  "details": "Changes in open beta audio now cause video playback to glitch/crackle and sometime skip audio, where the live version doesn't do this at all. Tested with multiple worlds, just one player, getting super solid 90fps. Affects all worlds with a videosync player, not just high bitrate videos but all videos suffer intermittent audio playback glitching.\n\nEDIT: it happens with live too now for me, maybe it's always been this sketchy, sorry I'll keep testing different clips and let others try it too, will update this when I'm sure",
